%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorFontSize": 13, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Inv as Investigator
    participant UI as UI React
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Gate as Approval Gate
    participant Hash as Hasher SHA-256
    participant Gen as YAML Gen
    participant SandSvc as Sandbox Svc
    participant SandFS as Sandbox FS
    participant OrigFS as Original FS (RO)

    Note over Inv,OrigFS: CASE 1: Generation attempt without prior approval
    Inv->>UI: Requests "Generate YAML" on 'Analizado' doc
    UI->>API: POST /documents/{id}/generate-yaml
    API->>Gate: assert_yaml_generation_allowed(doc)
    Gate-->>API: YAMLGenerationBlocked (status != 'Aprobado')
    API-->>UI: HTTP 403 Forbidden (Blocked)
    UI-->>Inv: Alert: Requires prior approval

    Note over Inv,OrigFS: CASE 2: Legitimate approval and YAML generation
    Inv->>UI: Reviews analysis, selects alternative, approves
    UI->>API: POST /documents/{id}/approve
    API->>Hash: compute_canonical_hash(doc) [11 fields]
    Hash-->>API: Canonical hash generated
    API->>API: doc.status = 'Aprobado', seals metadata
    API-->>UI: Document Aprobado in json/approved/

    Inv->>UI: Requests "Generate YAML"
    UI->>API: POST /documents/{id}/generate-yaml
    API->>Gate: assert_yaml_generation_allowed(doc)
    Gate->>Hash: compute_canonical_hash(doc)
    Hash-->>Gate: current_hash == approved_json_hash
    Gate-->>API: Authorization granted
    API->>Gen: generate_artifact_yamls(artifacts)
    Gen-->>API: YAMLs generated with hash in header
    API-->>UI: YAMLs ready in outputs/.../yaml/

    Note over Inv,OrigFS: CASE 3: Sandbox Installation and Original Protection
    Inv->>UI: Requests "Install in Sandbox"
    UI->>API: POST /experiments/{id}/install
    API->>SandSvc: validate_target_sandbox(target, exp, orig)
    alt Attempt in EthosTerra_original
        SandSvc-->>API: InstallationSecurityError (Forbidden)
        API-->>UI: HTTP 403/500 Attempt to mutate protected core
    else Confined in EthosTerra_experiment
        SandSvc->>SandSvc: create_instance_backup(exp, backups)
        SandSvc->>SandFS: Controlled copy of YAMLs
        SandSvc-->>API: Success with backup .tar.gz
        API-->>UI: HTTP 200 Installed in sandbox
    end

    Note over Inv,OrigFS: CASE 4: Post-approval tampering detection
    Inv->>UI: Requests "Generate YAML" after unaudited mutation
    UI->>API: POST /documents/{id}/generate-yaml
    API->>Gate: assert_yaml_generation_allowed(doc)
    Gate->>Hash: compute_canonical_hash(doc)
    Hash-->>Gate: current_hash != approved_json_hash
    Gate-->>API: HTTP 403 YAMLGenerationBlocked (Tampering)
    API-->>UI: Blocked: Hash mismatch
    UI-->>Inv: Alert: Unauthorized modification
